# Claude Code machine-local settings (permissions, local prefs) — never shared.
# The rest of .claude/ (commands, agents, docs) IS tracked on purpose.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Office temp / lock files (created while a .docx / .xlsx is open)
~$*

# Dependencies
node_modules/
package-lock.json
# Exception: the frontend lockfile IS committed on purpose — it pins a
# deterministic dependency tree so CI (npm ci) reproduces a known-good build.
# Without it, npm install produced a non-deterministic tree that broke the CI
# frontend build (ajv/ajv-keywords resolution). See CHANGELOG [1.20.8].
!frontend/package-lock.json
yarn.lock

